## Evidence discipline

This PR prepares the campaign only. It does not claim that any physical acceptance item has run or passed. The board ID is provisional and all hardware statuses remain `NOT_RUN`. Raw logs, photos and generated qualification packages must be collected by the operator on the identified physical sample.

